msgid "&#171; Vous ne voudrez plus jamais séjourner dans un hôtel. &#187;"
msgstr "&#171; You will never want to stay in a hotel again. &#187;"

msgid ""
"&ldquo;Charmante maison et emplacement paisible. Un s&eacute;jour d'une "
"semaine o&ugrave; tout le confort est l&agrave;, on se sent tr&egrave;s bien"
" dans leur belle propri&eacute;t&eacute; d&eacute;cor&eacute;e avec "
"go&ucirc;t, qui dispose de deux belles terrasses avec un petit jardin "
"privatif en herbe et cl&ocirc;tur&eacute;, id&eacute;al pour notre "
"beagle&nbsp;!&rdquo;"
msgstr ""
"&ldquo;Charming house and peaceful location. A one-week stay with every "
"comfort provided; we felt very good in their beautiful, tastefully decorated"
" property, which has two lovely terraces with a small private grassy fenced "
"garden, ideal for our beagle&nbsp;!&rdquo;"

msgid ""
"&ldquo;Le s&eacute;jour s'est tr&egrave;s bien pass&eacute;. Le logement "
"&eacute;tait incroyable&nbsp;: tr&egrave;s grand, tr&egrave;s propre, "
"tr&egrave;s fonctionnel, moderne, cuisine tr&egrave;s bien "
"&eacute;quip&eacute;e, terrasses et jardin tr&egrave;s agr&eacute;ables, "
"proche de la mer, propri&eacute;taires tr&egrave;s gentils.&rdquo;"
msgstr ""
"&ldquo;The stay went very well. The accommodation was incredible: very "
"large, very clean, very functional, modern, very well-equipped kitchen, very"
" pleasant terraces and garden, close to the sea, very kind owners.&rdquo;"

msgid ""
"&ldquo;Maison magnifique, avec un jardin paisible offrant un bel espace pour"
" se reposer et se ressourcer. Les propri&eacute;taires sont des personnes "
"accueillantes et chaleureuses.&rdquo;"
msgstr ""
"&ldquo;Beautiful house, with a peaceful garden offering a lovely space to "
"rest and recharge. The owners are welcoming and warm people.&rdquo;"

msgid ""
"&ldquo;Nous avons pass&eacute; un excellent s&eacute;jour dans la maison "
"d'Agn&egrave;s. Elle est situ&eacute;e dans un tr&egrave;s bel environnement"
" et tr&egrave;s proche de la mer &agrave; pieds ou en v&eacute;lo. La maison"
" est spacieuse, confortable et tr&egrave;s bien &eacute;quip&eacute;e. Nous "
"reviendrons certainement.&rdquo;"
msgstr ""
"&ldquo;We had an excellent stay at Agnès's house. It is located in a very "
"beautiful setting and very close to the sea on foot or by bike. The house is"
" spacious, comfortable and very well equipped. We will certainly come "
"back.&rdquo;"

msgid ""
"&ldquo;Nous avons pass&eacute; une superbe semaine au calme dans une jolie "
"villa bien &eacute;quip&eacute;e et bien plac&eacute;e. L'accueil "
"&eacute;tait tr&egrave;s bon et r&eacute;actif. Nous reviendrons avec "
"plaisir.&rdquo;"
msgstr ""
"&ldquo;We had a wonderful quiet week in a pretty, well-equipped and well-"
"located villa. The welcome was very good and responsive. We will gladly come"
" back.&rdquo;"

